# CloudFront CDN domain for serving recipe images
# When set, image URLs are constructed as https://{domain}/{path}
# instead of using pre-signed S3 URLs via Amplify Storage getUrl
# Requires a CloudFront distribution pointing to the S3 bucket
# with Origin Access Control configured.
# VITE_CLOUDFRONT_DOMAIN=d1q9k2f3g4h5i6.cloudfront.net
